e with subtlety and has taken away your blessing.","reference":"Genesis 27:35"},"isTranslated":false},{"title":"Sermon 3474 | Blessings Manifold and Marvelous","slug":"sermon_3474","volume":"volume-61","volumeNum":61,"scripture":{"verse":"He delivered me, because He delighted in me.","reference":"Psalm 18:19"},"isTranslated":false}],"total":3536,"totalPages":393,"currentPage":383}